<section>

    <h2>About AutoSlot</h2>

    <p>
        AutoSlot is a car service booking website designed
        to help customers book appointments for car wash
        and car maintenance services in advance.
    </p>

    <p>
        The main goal of this project is to reduce waiting time,
        avoid crowded service centers, and make the booking
        process easier and more organized.
    </p>

</section>



<section>

    <h3>Benefits of the Website</h3>

    <ol>

        <li>Save time for customers</li>

        <li>Reduce congestion in service centers</li>

        <li>Provide a more organized booking process</li>

        <li>Make car service access easier</li>

    </ol>

</section>



